lute address to the CTA Link field or leave it empty.'=>'You should enter a valid absolute address to the CTA Link field or leave it empty.','Adds an expandable content area below the description.'=>'Adds an expandable content area below the description.','CTA Label'=>'CTA Label','Custom'=>'Custom','Enable Akismet anti-spam protection'=>'Enable Akismet anti-spam protection','Enter text for the form field expanded description.'=>'Enter text for the form field expanded description.','Enter text for the form field heading.'=>'Enter text for the form field heading.','Expanded Content'=>'Expanded Content','Heading'=>'Heading','Internal Information'=>'Internal Information','Please fill out the field in required format.'=>'Please fill out the field in required format.','This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been activated</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.'=>'This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been activated</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.','This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been installed</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.'=>'This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been installed</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.','This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been properly configured</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.'=>'This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been properly configured</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.','This field is not editable'=>'This field is not editable','Accept payments using PayPal Commerce, Stripe, Square, PayPal Standard, and Mercado Pago'=>'Accept payments using PayPal Commerce, Stripe, Square, PayPal Standard, and Mercado Pago','Collect the names, emails, and messages from site visitors that need to talk to you.'=>'Collect the names, emails, and messages from site visitors that need to talk to you.','Mapbox API'=>'Mapbox API','The template you selected is currently not available, but you can try again later. If you continue to have trouble, please reach out to support.'=>'The template you selected is currently not available, but you can try again later. If you continue to have trouble, please reach out to support.','Congratulations! You Just Got Your 100th Form Entry!'=>'Congratulations! You Just Got Your 100th Form Entry!','If you could add just one feature to WPForms, what would it be? We want to know! Our team is busy surveying valued customers like you as we plan the year ahead. We’d love to know which features would take your business to the next level! Do you have a second to share your idea with us?'=>'If you could add just one feature to WPForms, what would it be? We want to know! Our team is busy surveying valued customers like you as we plan the year ahead. We’d love to know which features would take your business to the next level! Do you have a second to share your idea with us?','No such record.'=>'No such record.','Record ID not found'=>'Record ID not found','Share Your Idea'=>'Share Your Idea','Unique Value'=>'Unique Value','Update'=>'Update','Watch Video'=>'Watch Video','What’s Your Dream WPForms Feature?'=>'What’s Your Dream WPForms Feature?','You just hit 100 entries&hellip; and this is just the beginning! Now it’s time to dig into the data and figure out what makes your visitors tick. The User Journey addon shows you what your visitors looked at before submitting your form. Now you can easily find which areas of your site are triggering form conversions.'=>'You just hit 100 entries&hellip; and this is just the beginning! Now it’s time to dig into the data and figure out what makes your visitors tick. The User Journey add-on shows you what your visitors looked at before submitting your form. Now you can easily find which areas of your site are triggering form conversions.','Your form entries can’t be backed up because WPForms can’t connect to the backup server. If you’d like to back up your entries, find out how to <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fix entry backup issues</a>.'=>'Your form entries can’t be backed up because WPForms can’t connect to the backup server. If you’d like to back up your entries, find out how to <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fix entry backup issues</a>.','Are your forms converting fewer visitors than you hoped? Often, visitors quit forms partway through. That can prevent you from getting all the leads you deserve to capture. With our Form Abandonment addon, you can capture partial entries even if your visitor didn’t hit Submit! From there, it’s easy to follow up with leads and turn them into loyal customers.'=>'Are your forms converting fewer visitors than you hoped? Often, visitors quit forms partway through. That can prevent you from getting all the leads you deserve to capture. With our Form Abandonment add-on, you can capture partial entries even if your visitor didn’t hit Submit! From there, it’s easy to follow up with leads and turn them into loyal customers.','Did you know that many WordPress sites are not properly configured to send emails? With the free WP Mail SMTP plugin, you can easily optimize your site to send emails, avoid the spam folder, and make sure your emails land in the recipient’s inbox every time.'=>'Did you know that many WordPress sites are not properly configured to send emails? With the free WP Mail SMTP plugin, you can easily optimise your site to send emails, avoid the spam folder, and make sure your emails land in the recipient’s inbox every time.','Don’t Miss Your Form Notification Emails!'=>'Don’t Miss Your Form Notification Emails!','Get More Leads From Your Forms!'=>'Get More Leads From Your Forms!','Join Now'=>'Join Now','Nothing beats real feedback from your customers and visitors. That’s why many small businesses love our awesome Surveys and Polls addon. Instantly unlock full survey reporting right in your WordPress dashboard. And don’t forget: building a survey is easy with our pre-made templates, so you could get started within a few minutes!'=>'Nothing beats real feedback from your customers and visitors. That’s why many small businesses love our awesome Surveys and Polls add-on. Instantly unlock full survey reporting right in your WordPress dashboard. And don’t forget: building a survey is easy with our pre-made templates, so you could get started within a few minutes!','Read the Guide'=>'Read the Guide','Running a WordPress site can be challenging. But help is just around the corner! Our Facebook group contains tons of tips and help to get your business growing! When you join our VIP Circle, you’ll get instant access to tips, tricks, and answers from a community of loyal WPForms users. Best of all, membership is 100% free!'=>'Running a WordPress site can be challenging. But help is just around the corner! Our Facebook group contains tons of tips and help to get your business growing! When you join our VIP Circle, you’ll get instant access to tips, tricks, and answers from a community of loyal WPForms users. Best of all, membership is 100% free!','Start Building'=>'Start Building','Want to Be a VIP? Join Now!'=>'Want to Be a VIP? Join Now!','Want to Know What Your Customers Really Think?'=>'Want to Know What Your Customers Really Think?','We’re grateful that you chose WPForms for your website! Now that you’ve installed the plugin, you’re less than 5 minutes away from publishing your first form. To make it easy, we’ve got %s form templates to get you started!'=>'We’re grateful that you chose WPForms for your website! Now that you’ve installed the plugin, you’re less than 5 minutes away from publishing your first form. To make it easy, we’ve got %s form templates to get you started!',', '=>', ','1 tag was successfully deleted.'=>'1 tag was successfully deleted.','<strong>1 form</strong> selected for Bulk Edit.'=>'<strong>1 form</strong> selected for Bulk Edit.','<strong>%d forms</strong> selected for Bulk Edit.'=>'<strong>%d forms</strong> selected for Bulk Edit.','All Tags'=>'All Tags','Almost done!'=>'Almost done!','Delete tags that you\'re no longer using. Deleting a tag will remove it from a form, but will not delete the form itself.'=>'Delete tags that you\'re no longer using. Deleting a tag will remove it from a form, but will not delete the form itself.','Delete Tags'=>'Delete Tags','Edit Tags'=>'Edit Tags','Filter'=>'Filter','In order to update the tags in the forms list, please refresh the page.'=>'In order to update the tags in the forms list, please refresh the page.','Manage Tags'=>'Manage Tags','Most likely, your session expired. Please reload the page.'=>'Most likely, your session expired. Please reload the page.','No forms selected when trying to add a tag to them.'=>'No forms selected when trying to add a tag to them.','No tags to choose from'=>'No tags to choose from','Refresh'=>'Refresh','Save changes'=>'Save changes','Türkiye'=>'Türkiye','There are no tags to delete.<br>Please create at least one by adding it to any form.'=>'There are no tags to delete.<br>Please create at least one by adding it to any form.','We’ve detected the same text in your allowlist and denylist. To prevent a conflict, we’ve removed the following text from the list you’re currently viewing:'=>'We’ve detected the same text in your allowlist and denylist. To prevent a conflict, we’ve removed the following text from the list you’re currently viewing:','Welcome to WPForms!'=>'Welcome to WPForms!','You have <strong>%d tags</strong> selected for deletion.'=>'You have <strong>%d tags</strong> selected for deletion.','You have <strong>1 tag</strong> selected for deletion.'=>'You have <strong>1 tag</strong> selected for deletion.','Enable Prefill by URL'=>'Enable Prefill by URL','Enter a %s nickname'=>'Enter a %s nickname','How to use Prefill by URL'=>'How to use Prefill by URL','Mark form with the tags. To create a new tag, simply type it and press Enter.'=>'Mark form with the tags. To create a new tag, simply type it and press Enter.','Press Enter or "," key to add new tag'=>'Press Enter or "," key to add new tag','Tags'=>'Tags','Color Scheme'=>'Colour Scheme','<strong>Your form entries are not being stored in WordPress, and your entry backups are not active.</strong> If there\'s a problem with deliverability, you\'ll lose form entries. We recommend that you enable Entry Backups, especially if you\'re considering <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-upgrade-modal">upgrading to WPForms PRO</a>.'=>'<strong>Your form entries are not being stored in WordPress, and your entry backups are not active.</strong> If there\'s a problem with deliverability, you\'ll lose form entries. We recommend that you enable Entry Backups, especially if you\'re considering <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-upgrade-modal">upgrading to WPForms PRO</a>.','Bar'=>'Bar','Graph Style'=>'Grap